{
    "data": [
        {
            "title": "比特幣跌破68,000美元，Anthropic IPO熱潮抽走市場流動性",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"606\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/fa6ef33450cdd0f369f8246fade46e6872601b203db6c613c2b418ff3f29fde2/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fcontent-media.investing.com%2Fnews%2FLYNXNPEB701AO_M.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><strong>Investing.com -</strong> 比特幣週六跌破68,000美元，自10月初以來累計跌幅已逾20%。投資者在科技板塊動盪之際削減風險資產敞口，同時擔憂Anthropic即將進行的超大規模IPO可能將資金從加密貨幣市場抽走。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">截至美國東部時間00:54（北京時間12:54），全球最大加密貨幣報67,034.6美元，當日跌幅1.61%。盤中一度跌破67,000美元，創下自8月以來的最低水平，數字資產及科技股的拋售壓力持續加劇。</p><div class=\"bg-toast-background -mx-5 -mt-2 mb-3 pb-3 md:-mx-0 lg:mx-auto lg:w-[300px] lg:pb-0\"><div class=\"text-px14 text-gandalf py-1 text-center leading-5\">廣告</div><div class=\"mx-auto text-center min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px]\" id=\"sda-inbody-2b265353-ea5d-3e16-b927-554ec1491ff2-1-iframe\"><div class=\"bg-dirty-seagull text-px12 text-dolphin mx-auto hidden items-center justify-center only:flex w-[300px] h-[250px]\">廣告</div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Anthropic計劃上市，尋求募資最高644億美元，已成為市場流動性收緊的潛在壓力來源。</p><div class=\"recommendation-contents\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mb-2 h-[30px] w-[80px] rounded-lg\"></div><div class=\"no-scrollbar -mx-5 mb-5 flex overflow-hidden overflow-x-auto md:-mx-2 lg:mb-3.5\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mr-2 ml-5 h-[94px] w-[calc(85%-28px)] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg md:ml-2 md:w-[calc(85%-16px)] lg:w-[300px]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mx-2 h-[94px] w-[85%] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:w-[300px]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow hidden h-[94px] w-[300px] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:block\"></div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">據報道，市場對此次IPO的認購需求是可供股份的六倍，引發外界猜測，部分投資者正在拋售比特幣及其他流動性較高的資產，以籌集認購資金。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Xapo Bank行政總裁Seamus Rocca將加密貨幣此輪下跌部分歸因於資金流向Anthropic，並將其與SpaceX今年6月IPO前後的流動性壓力相提並論。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">科技板塊的波動進一步加劇了市場疲軟，英偉達管理層動盪亦令情緒受挫，不過分析師提醒，不宜將比特幣的跌勢直接歸咎於這家芯片巨頭的內部變動。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">與此同時，市場擔憂Strategy可能被剔除出MSCI指數，引發追蹤相關基準的基金被迫拋售的隱憂，進一步加重了市場壓力。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">此外，空倉持倉量上升，以及貝萊德iShares比特幣信託持續錄得資金流出，顯示加密貨幣投資者普遍保持謹慎態度。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">此輪下跌亦波及貴金屬市場，顯示當前的拋售並非單純針對加密貨幣，而是更廣泛的投資組合去槓桿化所致。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">歷史走勢或提供一定參考。Strive行政總裁Matt Cole指出，比特幣在SpaceX IPO前曾下跌19%，而在Anthropic計劃上市前，跌幅約為18%，兩者走勢頗為相似。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">比特幣在SpaceX上市後隨即出現反彈，但此次能否重演同樣走勢，目前仍存在不確定性。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">另一方面，灰度（Grayscale）研究發現，過去三年間，比特幣約佔加密板塊回報波動的一半，這表明數字資產的多元化投資機會正在擴大。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">該機構亦指出，在過去兩年中，市值最大的十種非穩定幣加密資產裡，每季度領漲的幣種各有不同，共有六種加密貨幣曾輪流奪得季度榜首，而比特幣從未位居第一。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">另有消息顯示，一個自2011年起便沉寂多年的加密錢包，在收到一宗涉及長期閒置加密資產擁有權的訴訟法律通知後，轉出了75枚比特幣，市值約500萬美元。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">此次轉帳證明該錢包仍處於有效控制之下，但目前尚無法確認這是否與相關訴訟直接相關。</p><h2 class=\"mb-module-gap leading-[1.35] text-px22 font-bold lg:text-px24 text-batcave\"><strong>今日加密貨幣行情：週六山寨幣普遍下跌</strong></h2><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">根據最新市場數據，週六大多數加密貨幣均錄得跌幅。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">全球市值第二大加密貨幣<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"以太幣\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:以太幣;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://hk.investing.com/crypto/ethereum/eth-usd?utm_medium=feed&amp;utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_campaign=yahoo-hk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">以太幣</a>下跌0.35%，報1,904.97美元。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">全球市值第三大加密貨幣<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"XRP\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:XRP;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://hk.investing.com/crypto/xrp/xrp-usd?utm_medium=feed&amp;utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_campaign=yahoo-hk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">XRP</a>下跌1.57%，報0.9964美元。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"Solana\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:Solana;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://hk.investing.com/crypto/solana/sol-usd?utm_medium=feed&amp;utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_campaign=yahoo-hk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Solana</a>大跌3.27%，報75.96美元；<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"BNB\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:BNB;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://hk.investing.com/crypto/bnb/bnb-usd?utm_medium=feed&amp;utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_campaign=yahoo-hk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">BNB</a>則下跌2.02%，報621.31美元。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"卡爾達諾\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:卡爾達諾;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://hk.investing.com/crypto/cardano/ada-usd?utm_medium=feed&amp;utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_campaign=yahoo-hk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">卡爾達諾</a>（Cardano）跌3.33%，報0.1653美元；<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"狗狗幣\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:狗狗幣;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://hk.investing.com/crypto/dogecoin/doge-usd?utm_medium=feed&amp;utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_campaign=yahoo-hk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">狗狗幣</a>則下跌1.91%。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">在迷因幣方面，<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"TRUMP\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:TRUMP;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://hk.investing.com/crypto/maga/trump-usd?utm_medium=feed&amp;utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_campaign=yahoo-hk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">TRUMP</a>當日基本持平，而<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"柴犬幣\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:柴犬幣;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://hk.investing.com/crypto/shiba-inu/shib-usd?utm_medium=feed&amp;utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_campaign=yahoo-hk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">柴犬幣</a>（Shiba Inu）則下跌1.17%。</p></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/%E6%AF%94%E7%89%B9%E5%B9%A3%E8%B7%8C%E7%A0%B468-000%E7%BE%8E%E5%85%83-anthropic-ipo%E7%86%B1%E6%BD%AE%E6%8A%BD%E8%B5%B0%E5%B8%82%E5%A0%B4%E6%B5%81%E5%8B%95%E6%80%A7-064956594.html",
